###read all users
GET http://localhost:6000/user-api/users



###read a user by id
GET http://localhost:6000/user-api/user


###create new user
POST http://localhost:6000/user-api/users
Content-Type: application/json   

{   
    "userName":"Samhi",
    "password":"Samhita",
    "email":"sam@gmail.com",
    "age":19
}



###update a user
PUT http://localhost:6000/user-api/users/69aa91658171f81562e02607
Content-Type: application/json

{   
    "userName":"Samhi",
    "password":"Samhita14",
    "email":"samhita@gmail.com",
    "age":19
}

###delete a user by id
DELETE http://localhost:6000/user-api/users/69aa91658171f81562e02607

###add product to user cart
PUT http://localhost:6000/user-api/cart/product-id/
Content-Type: application/json



