###create new product
POST http://localhost:6000/product-api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
"productId":67890,
"productName":"Cream",
"brand":"Dove",
"price":150
}


###read all products
GET http://localhost:6000/product-api/products


###Read all products by productId
GET http://localhost:6000/product-api/products/69bd3ea3cbb29780acc0fe1a


###Update a product
PUT http://localhost:6000/product-api/products/69bd3ea3cbb29780acc0fe1a
Content-Type: application/json

{
"productId":23456,
"productName":"Oil",
"brand":"Fortune",
"price":150
}


###delete a product by id 
DELETE http://localhost:6000/product-api/products/69bd3ea3cbb29780acc0fe1a